1
00:00:51,009 --> 00:00:52,677
Whatever Mama Yaya has planned,

2
00:00:52,761 --> 00:00:54,220
<i>I'll leave that up to her.</i>

3
00:00:54,304 --> 00:00:57,098
If there's one thing
I've learned all these years,

4
00:00:57,599 --> 00:01:01,311
it's that love is ultimately a decision.

5
00:01:02,812 --> 00:01:04,939
Mikoy, Chiara is missing.

6
00:01:05,023 --> 00:01:07,108
- She's not in the bridal car either.
- Are you sure?

7
00:01:07,192 --> 00:01:09,069
Maybe she just went to the bathroom.

8
00:01:09,152 --> 00:01:10,445
That's possible, but…

9
00:01:10,528 --> 00:01:11,654
I'll go look for Chiara.

10
00:01:11,738 --> 00:01:13,948
- Let's go check!
- What's happening?

11
00:01:14,574 --> 00:01:16,785
- Hey!
- Wait, Mikoy!

12
00:01:20,121 --> 00:01:23,583
Don't you have any leads or information
from your informants?

13
00:01:23,666 --> 00:01:26,085
Maybe she's just a runaway bride.

14
00:01:26,169 --> 00:01:27,587
Besides, Mario,

15
00:01:27,670 --> 00:01:31,132
it's no longer news that the bride
used to be part of the mafia.

16
00:01:31,216 --> 00:01:33,218
Maybe she went back to her old life.

17
00:01:34,177 --> 00:01:36,054
We also spoke to Donabel and Viktor.

18
00:01:36,137 --> 00:01:38,640
<i>The family even talked</i>
<i>before Chiara left the hotel.</i>

19
00:01:38,723 --> 00:01:42,560
We also spoke to everyone
who came into contact with Chiara.

20
00:01:42,644 --> 00:01:44,771
<i>None of them noticed anything unusual.</i>

21
00:01:44,854 --> 00:01:47,232
<i>In fact, they all said the same thing.</i>

22
00:01:47,315 --> 00:01:52,153
That Chiara was a beautiful
and excited bride.

23
00:01:55,990 --> 00:01:59,202
<i>Yes, sir. Viktor and Donabel</i>
<i>are with us right now.</i>

24
00:01:59,786 --> 00:02:01,996
We'll be leaving soon as well.

25
00:02:04,791 --> 00:02:07,293
I'll arrange for additional escorts

26
00:02:07,377 --> 00:02:10,421
for your trip back to Manila
to make sure you're all safe.

27
00:02:11,005 --> 00:02:12,382
- Thank you, sir.
- Thank you, sir.

28
00:02:12,465 --> 00:02:13,675
<i>Take care.</i>

29
00:02:14,259 --> 00:02:16,136
With Chiara suddenly disappearing,

30
00:02:16,219 --> 00:02:20,306
we can't completely rule out
a connection between

31
00:02:33,862 --> 00:02:35,905
Where could Chiara be?

32
00:02:36,531 --> 00:02:39,659
What if that was the last time
we ever saw Chiara?

33
00:02:39,742 --> 00:02:41,244
Don't say that, Dekyo.

34
00:02:42,495 --> 00:02:44,706
We may not know where Chiara is,

35
00:02:45,790 --> 00:02:48,001
but I'm sure she's perfectly safe
wherever she is right now.

36
00:02:48,751 --> 00:02:49,794
That's right.

37
00:02:49,878 --> 00:02:52,213
Besides, she used to be
a world-class assassin.

38
00:02:52,297 --> 00:02:55,633
She can definitely defend herself
against kidnappers.

39
00:02:56,634 --> 00:02:57,510
Yes.

40
00:02:57,594 --> 00:02:59,137
You're already talking about kidnappers,
and we don't even have

41
00:02:59,220 --> 00:03:00,763
any clear information yet.

42
00:03:01,431 --> 00:03:06,060
So let's take it easy
with our thoughts and our reactions.

43
00:03:06,728 --> 00:03:08,730
I know we're all worried about Chiara,

44
00:03:08,813 --> 00:03:10,064
but of course, we should just

45
00:03:10,940 --> 00:03:12,400
relax and stay calm.

46
00:03:12,483 --> 00:03:13,359
Okay.

47
00:03:13,443 --> 00:03:16,404
Of all the people
whose wedding outfits I've sewn,

48
00:03:16,487 --> 00:03:17,989
Mikoy is the only one
whose bride didn't show up.

49
00:03:18,072 --> 00:03:19,699
I don't know what happened.

50
00:03:19,782 --> 00:03:23,536
Remember,
Chiara used to be part of the mafia.

51
00:03:23,620 --> 00:03:27,165
They say, once you're in a syndicate,
you're always in a syndicate.

52
00:03:27,248 --> 00:03:28,166
That's how you see it.

53
00:03:28,249 --> 00:03:30,460
I mean, it's hard to get out.

54
00:03:30,543 --> 00:03:32,670
Do you think there's
some unfinished business there?

55
00:03:33,338 --> 00:03:34,172
Oh, no.

56
00:03:34,255 --> 00:03:36,174
What if the rumors are true

57
00:03:36,257 --> 00:03:37,884
and Chiara was kidnapped?

58
00:03:41,596 --> 00:03:44,599
For now, just extend
your stay there, Alex.

59
00:03:47,727 --> 00:03:49,604
<i>Keep an eye on your surroundings.</i>

60
00:03:49,687 --> 00:03:53,900
Maybe we're looking too far ahead
when the answer is right within

61
00:03:53,983 --> 00:03:55,777
our peripheral vision.

62
00:03:57,237 --> 00:03:58,321
Besides,

63
00:03:59,030 --> 00:04:00,907
I have a feeling about this Rahmboy.

64
00:04:03,618 --> 00:04:05,745
Sir, Rahmboy? The vlogger?

65
00:04:05,828 --> 00:04:07,580
The aspiring content creator?

66
00:04:07,664 --> 00:04:08,873
Yes.

67
00:04:09,374 --> 00:04:10,667
He may look harmless,

68
00:04:10,750 --> 00:04:13,670
but if you look into his profile,

69
00:04:14,295 --> 00:04:15,380
it's like…

70
00:04:16,339 --> 00:04:17,924
it's too good to be true.

71
00:04:38,486 --> 00:04:41,572
I think it could be
some kind of curse or witchcraft.

72
00:04:41,656 --> 00:04:43,491
Oh, please. I don't believe in that.

73
00:04:43,574 --> 00:04:47,495
It's more believable
that she simply changed her mind.

74
00:04:47,578 --> 00:04:49,414
No, I don't think so.

75
00:04:49,497 --> 00:04:51,291
Chiara looked completely
head over heels in love when she

76
00:04:51,374 --> 00:04:52,500
was trying on her gown.

77
00:04:53,084 --> 00:04:54,627
Sure, she may be in love now,

78
00:04:54,711 --> 00:04:57,338
but maybe she's having doubts
about the future.

79
00:04:57,422 --> 00:04:59,215
Oh, come on, you guys.

80
00:04:59,882 --> 00:05:03,386
It's as if you've never experienced
Chiara's kindness.

81
00:05:03,469 --> 00:05:06,055
You're gossiping about her nonstop.

82
00:05:06,639 --> 00:05:07,765
They are.

83
00:05:07,849 --> 00:05:08,933
You too!

84
00:05:09,517 --> 00:05:10,351
You know,

85
00:05:11,561 --> 00:05:14,314
none of us knows what really happened.

86
00:05:14,897 --> 00:05:16,774
So maybe the best thing we can do

87
00:05:16,858 --> 00:05:20,570
is pray together that Chiara is safe.

88
00:05:22,363 --> 00:05:24,949
We've already searched all over Albay,

89
00:05:25,033 --> 00:05:26,909
but we still haven't found Chiara.

90
00:05:26,993 --> 00:05:28,703
It's like she vanished into thin air.

91
00:05:28,786 --> 00:05:31,080
Exactly. So what if
we can't find her because…

92
00:05:31,831 --> 00:05:33,291
She doesn't want to be found?

93
00:05:35,168 --> 00:05:36,044
That's impossible.

94
00:05:36,127 --> 00:05:39,505
What, do you think she actually planned
not to show up at her own wedding?

95
00:05:39,589 --> 00:05:41,924
And leave Brother Mikoy standing there
like an idiot, waiting at the altar?

96
00:05:42,008 --> 00:05:43,551
Chiara wouldn't do that.

97
00:05:45,928 --> 00:05:47,764
She wouldn't just leave me like that.

98
00:05:48,347 --> 00:05:50,141
Because we made a promise to each other.

99
00:05:50,933 --> 00:05:52,560
So will you please just stop?

100
00:05:52,643 --> 00:05:54,145
You're not helping.

101
00:05:55,271 --> 00:05:56,689
Chiara is missing,

102
00:05:56,773 --> 00:05:58,691
and she needs our help.

103
00:06:01,486 --> 00:06:02,987
I don't know where to start,

104
00:06:03,071 --> 00:06:06,324
but I won't stop
until I bring her back here.

105
00:06:08,034 --> 00:06:09,619
Whatever happens, son,

106
00:06:09,702 --> 00:06:11,913
we're here to support you.

107
00:06:12,622 --> 00:06:15,166
But maybe you need to get some rest first.

108
00:06:15,249 --> 00:06:17,001
It's been a very long day.

109
00:06:17,085 --> 00:06:19,378
But Mom, we're wasting time.

110
00:06:19,462 --> 00:06:20,630
Mikoy.

111
00:06:20,713 --> 00:06:24,008
The agency and the local police
are all helping us.

112
00:06:24,092 --> 00:06:25,968
I think Tess is right.

113
00:06:26,052 --> 00:06:27,261
- You should get some rest first.
- Mom!

114
00:06:27,929 --> 00:06:31,390
Chiara could be in even more danger
if we stop looking for her.

115
00:06:50,785 --> 00:06:51,828
Mikoy.

116
00:06:53,579 --> 00:06:54,997
I understand you.

117
00:06:56,207 --> 00:06:58,668
I won't judge you
because your concerns are valid,

118
00:06:58,751 --> 00:07:00,837
as are your fears and worries.

119
00:07:02,004 --> 00:07:03,673
But I want you to know,

120
00:07:05,133 --> 00:07:07,135
we love Chiara too.

121
00:07:08,803 --> 00:07:10,263
And we're worried about her too.

122
00:07:13,057 --> 00:07:15,017
Maybe what we should do for now,

123
00:07:16,602 --> 00:07:18,438
while we wait for any news,

124
00:07:20,231 --> 00:07:22,024
is take care of each other.

125
00:07:23,192 --> 00:07:24,861
Wait?

126
00:07:24,944 --> 00:07:26,028
Dad!

127
00:07:26,654 --> 00:07:29,866
If the Concordat really had something
to do with Chiara's disappearance,

128
00:07:30,491 --> 00:07:32,326
they're not the type
to just sit around and wait.

129
00:07:32,410 --> 00:07:33,911
They're criminals!

130
00:07:33,995 --> 00:07:35,621
We're wasting time, Dad.

131
00:07:37,623 --> 00:07:39,959
But there's also a time to rest

132
00:07:40,042 --> 00:07:41,335
and regain your strength.

133
00:07:42,587 --> 00:07:43,963
I'm sorry

134
00:07:44,464 --> 00:07:47,550
if I don't have any good news for you,

135
00:07:47,633 --> 00:07:51,387
but I want you to know
that we're all on your side.

136
00:07:52,430 --> 00:07:54,432
And all we want

137
00:07:55,850 --> 00:07:58,186
is for you and Chiara to be okay.

138
00:08:02,231 --> 00:08:03,566
I'm sorry, Dad.

139
00:08:05,985 --> 00:08:07,445
This is just so hard.

140
00:08:09,322 --> 00:08:10,281
It's okay.

141
00:08:12,116 --> 00:08:16,579
If I were in your position,
I'd probably do the same thing.

142
00:08:17,288 --> 00:08:20,208
But you really need
to get some rest, so tomorrow,

143
00:08:20,291 --> 00:08:22,418
we can resume the search.

144
00:08:22,502 --> 00:08:23,878
But Dad…

145
00:08:24,712 --> 00:08:25,713
Please.

146
00:08:25,796 --> 00:08:28,299
As your father, please grant me this.

147
00:08:29,425 --> 00:08:30,968
Get some rest.

148
00:08:31,052 --> 00:08:32,053
Even just for a while.

149
00:08:39,685 --> 00:08:40,978
Thank you, Dad.

150
00:08:43,523 --> 00:08:46,275
I just don't know what I'll do
if something bad happens to Chiara.

151
00:08:46,359 --> 00:08:48,903
Nothing bad will happen to her.

152
00:08:50,655 --> 00:08:52,406
Just have faith, son.

153
00:09:13,135 --> 00:09:14,971
<i>I've kept so many secrets</i>

154
00:09:15,054 --> 00:09:20,059
<i>just so I could give our family</i>
<i>a simple and peaceful life, Mikoy.</i>

155
00:09:21,269 --> 00:09:22,562
<i>Sometimes,</i>

156
00:09:22,645 --> 00:09:26,566
<i>I feel like fate is making me pay</i>
<i>for all those things.</i>

157
00:09:28,651 --> 00:09:31,779
<i>But how can I explain</i>
<i>the thing that I saw earlier?</i>

158
00:09:38,286 --> 00:09:41,247
<i>Chiara. What are you doing?</i>

159
00:09:41,330 --> 00:09:43,040
<i>And where are you going?</i>

160
00:09:53,426 --> 00:09:55,761
<i>It's been so hard for me</i>
<i>to keep this from you.</i>

161
00:09:56,804 --> 00:09:58,723
<i>But I promise you.</i>

162
00:09:59,807 --> 00:10:02,184
<i>I'll find out the truth, son.</i>

163
00:10:08,065 --> 00:10:09,066
Hey!

164
00:10:09,150 --> 00:10:11,193
Our king is giving us
the silent treatment.

165
00:10:11,777 --> 00:10:13,279
He comes and goes with authorization,

166
00:10:13,362 --> 00:10:14,822
then returns whenever he feels like it.

167
00:10:14,905 --> 00:10:16,532
Where did you go?

168
00:10:18,826 --> 00:10:20,036
Hey.

169
00:10:21,996 --> 00:10:22,830
Huh?

170
00:10:22,913 --> 00:10:24,874
You're acting more like gangsters
than the inmates in there.

171
00:10:24,957 --> 00:10:26,667
Want me to put you inside?

172
00:10:26,751 --> 00:10:27,585
Huh?

173
00:10:27,668 --> 00:10:29,337
We're just disciplining him, sir.

174
00:10:29,420 --> 00:10:30,755
Disciplining him?

175
00:10:31,547 --> 00:10:33,049
Are you his father?

176
00:10:33,132 --> 00:10:33,966
His mother?

177
00:10:34,050 --> 00:10:38,179
Get out of my sight before I turn
those uniforms of yours orange.

178
00:10:38,971 --> 00:10:39,972
Get out!

179
00:10:49,315 --> 00:10:50,524
I heard what happened,

180
00:10:52,193 --> 00:10:53,402
and I'm here to protect you.

181
00:11:04,372 --> 00:11:06,582
Is there still no news about my daughter?

182
00:11:07,917 --> 00:11:09,460
Not yet, for now.

183
00:11:09,960 --> 00:11:11,170
But don't worry.

184
00:11:11,253 --> 00:11:13,172
Agent Alex and the others
are doing everything

185
00:11:13,255 --> 00:11:15,007
they can to find Chiara.

186
00:11:15,591 --> 00:11:17,176
I trust Agent Alex.

187
00:11:17,259 --> 00:11:18,928
She can find anything.

188
00:11:19,512 --> 00:11:20,930
After all, she found me.

189
00:11:22,765 --> 00:11:23,682
Anyway,

190
00:11:23,766 --> 00:11:26,352
I'll patrol around for now.
The guards might get suspicious

191
00:11:26,435 --> 00:11:28,104
if they notice I'm keeping
a close watch on you.

192
00:11:43,035 --> 00:11:46,038
It's not like Chiara
to just vanish into thin air.

193
00:11:48,082 --> 00:11:49,250
I think something happened to her.

194
00:12:06,016 --> 00:12:07,101
Mikoy.

195
00:12:08,102 --> 00:12:09,603
Are you okay?

196
00:12:10,187 --> 00:12:15,192
Maybe you should
get some rest first, you know.

197
00:12:16,068 --> 00:12:19,029
I won't rest until I find Chiara.

198
00:12:19,822 --> 00:12:24,160
Even Mario hasn't stopped
looking for Chiara either.

199
00:12:24,660 --> 00:12:26,370
We can't find him either.

200
00:12:34,170 --> 00:12:38,424
<i>Chiara. What are you and Vicky planning?</i>

201
00:12:43,387 --> 00:12:45,931
<i>Does Vicky have</i>
<i>any other connection to Chiara?</i>

202
00:12:46,724 --> 00:12:48,767
<i>Other than being her nanny?</i>

203
00:12:51,353 --> 00:12:54,356
<i>Because it seems like my son</i>
<i>is in danger again.</i>

204
00:12:54,440 --> 00:12:59,278
<i>I will ensure the safety</i>
<i>of Mikoy and my family.</i>

205
00:12:59,361 --> 00:13:01,280
<i>I will find out the truth.</i>

206
00:13:21,300 --> 00:13:23,469
I've done everything you asked me to do.

207
00:13:25,221 --> 00:13:26,514
I came here with you.

208
00:13:28,474 --> 00:13:31,143
What do you mean when you say
Mikoy's life would be in danger

209
00:13:31,227 --> 00:13:32,520
if the wedding went through?

210
00:13:32,603 --> 00:13:33,729
What's going on?

211
00:13:34,313 --> 00:13:36,857
This is all Rio de Janyx's fault.

212
00:13:37,942 --> 00:13:42,571
I only found out
that he planned to use Mikoy's life,

213
00:13:42,655 --> 00:13:43,739
his family,

214
00:13:43,822 --> 00:13:46,325
and even the people he loves against you

215
00:13:46,408 --> 00:13:48,494
if you went through with the marriage.

216
00:13:52,122 --> 00:13:53,916
He wants you, my child.

217
00:14:02,299 --> 00:14:03,801
I don't know him.

218
00:14:03,884 --> 00:14:05,970
He doesn't even know me.

219
00:14:06,053 --> 00:14:07,763
I've never even seen his face.

220
00:14:09,765 --> 00:14:13,602
You know how
these things work with royal families.

221
00:14:21,652 --> 00:14:23,737
So if you become his wife,

222
00:14:23,821 --> 00:14:27,157
no one will challenge him
or his position anymore.

223
00:14:27,783 --> 00:14:30,327
His position as the head
of the Concordat will be secured.

224
00:14:30,411 --> 00:14:32,037
Is he crazy?

225
00:14:33,664 --> 00:14:34,790
Maybe.

226
00:14:40,254 --> 00:14:43,090
I'm not marrying him. Never!

227
00:14:44,508 --> 00:14:47,303
You need to become La Morte Bianca.

228
00:14:48,387 --> 00:14:50,806
You need to fulfill your promise.

229
00:14:50,890 --> 00:14:52,725
Take the throne.

230
00:14:55,477 --> 00:14:57,563
Didn't I already tell you?

231
00:14:58,522 --> 00:14:59,815
I don't want this anymore!

232
00:15:02,276 --> 00:15:04,570
So why are you forcing this on me?

233
00:15:05,154 --> 00:15:07,031
I'm not forcing you, my child.

234
00:15:13,287 --> 00:15:14,705
He's blackmailing you.

235
00:15:15,289 --> 00:15:16,790
To put an end to this,

236
00:15:16,874 --> 00:15:20,920
you have to kill the person
he's using to blackmail you,

237
00:15:21,003 --> 00:15:23,005
or kill the blackmailer himself.

238
00:15:23,088 --> 00:15:24,131
You choose.

239
00:15:29,803 --> 00:15:32,056
There's too much happening.

240
00:15:33,599 --> 00:15:35,643
Isn't there a better way?

241
00:15:41,523 --> 00:15:42,816
But remember,

242
00:15:42,900 --> 00:15:46,236
once a mafia, always a mafia.

243
00:15:47,196 --> 00:15:51,492
You can't escape what's already
been destined for you, my child.

244
00:16:15,975 --> 00:16:17,559
What do you mean you can't find Dad Mario?

245
00:16:17,643 --> 00:16:20,187
Yes, but he's probably
just around here somewhere.

246
00:16:20,270 --> 00:16:22,648
He's asking the police questions,

247
00:16:22,731 --> 00:16:24,817
trying to get information, so, of course,

248
00:16:24,900 --> 00:16:26,694
he can find Chiara, right?

249
00:16:27,695 --> 00:16:29,196
What about the barangay watchmen?

250
00:16:29,279 --> 00:16:31,156
Didn't they notice anything unusual?

251
00:16:31,824 --> 00:16:35,160
Don't put too much faith
in the people around here.

252
00:16:35,244 --> 00:16:37,621
Ever since they heard
that Chiara went missing,

253
00:16:37,705 --> 00:16:40,332
they've been spreading
all kinds of fake news.

254
00:16:40,416 --> 00:16:43,293
Yes. All I care about
right now is finding Chiara.

255
00:16:43,377 --> 00:16:44,211
That's all.

256
00:17:03,731 --> 00:17:05,357
Mikoy, can I talk to you?

257
00:17:05,941 --> 00:17:07,276
Why?

258
00:17:07,359 --> 00:17:08,694
Is this about Chiara?

259
00:17:09,486 --> 00:17:12,197
It might be better if we talk in private.

260
00:17:12,281 --> 00:17:13,323
No, it's okay.

261
00:17:13,824 --> 00:17:14,992
They're family.

262
00:17:15,701 --> 00:17:16,535
Why?

263
00:17:22,416 --> 00:17:24,668
When I learned that you and Chiara
had settled here,

264
00:17:24,752 --> 00:17:26,211
I had everyone profiled and monitored,

265
00:17:26,295 --> 00:17:28,756
just to make sure there
wouldn't be any problems.

266
00:17:28,839 --> 00:17:30,591
Have everyone here background-checked.

267
00:17:30,674 --> 00:17:32,926
Everyone around Mikoy.

268
00:17:33,010 --> 00:17:34,219
<i>Everyone?</i>

269
00:17:34,303 --> 00:17:35,512
Everyone.

270
00:17:35,596 --> 00:17:37,598
From Pepe to Rahmboy.

271
00:17:38,599 --> 00:17:40,142
At first, we didn't find anything.

272
00:17:41,351 --> 00:17:43,520
Until Mrs. Corales came along.

273
00:17:44,021 --> 00:17:44,897
Mom?

274
00:17:51,820 --> 00:17:53,530
<i>When Dara did a background check on her,</i>

275
00:17:53,614 --> 00:17:55,491
she had worked
for years in a part of Italy

276
00:17:55,574 --> 00:17:58,327
where the Concordat has a strong presence.

277
00:18:00,662 --> 00:18:01,914
At first,

278
00:18:01,997 --> 00:18:03,791
we thought it might just be a coincidence.

279
00:18:05,250 --> 00:18:08,212
Until we dug deeper and found that she had
a connection to La Morte Bianca.

280
00:18:08,295 --> 00:18:10,964
She is her personal housekeeper.

281
00:18:13,801 --> 00:18:14,760
Wait.

282
00:18:14,843 --> 00:18:16,053
What are you saying?

283
00:18:22,559 --> 00:18:24,186
And the same goes for Rahmboy.

284
00:18:24,269 --> 00:18:25,979
What about him?

285
00:18:26,063 --> 00:18:27,523
This is insane!

286
00:18:27,606 --> 00:18:28,607
This is such a mess!

287
00:18:29,191 --> 00:18:30,567
We have reason to believe

288
00:18:30,651 --> 00:18:33,570
that all this time, the Concordat
has never stopped keeping an eye on you.

289
00:18:35,656 --> 00:18:37,825
Then we need to do everything
we can to get her back.

290
00:18:40,536 --> 00:18:42,121
- It's not that easy?
- You don't understand.

291
00:18:42,204 --> 00:18:43,413
- Mikoy!
- You listen to me!

292
00:18:43,497 --> 00:18:45,124
When you asked me for help,

293
00:18:45,207 --> 00:18:46,750
- I agreed.
- Wait, what’s going on?

294
00:18:46,834 --> 00:18:48,627
I gave everything to the agency.
Everything!

295
00:18:48,710 --> 00:18:50,045
- Just a second, Mikoy.
- Mikoy.

296
00:18:50,129 --> 00:18:51,588
- You owe me.
- Calm down, Mikoy.

297
00:18:51,672 --> 00:18:53,215
For all the sacrifices I've made.

298
00:18:53,841 --> 00:18:55,175
Now I'm coming to collect.

299
00:18:55,259 --> 00:18:57,719
- Mikoy.
- The person that I love

300
00:18:57,803 --> 00:18:59,263
needs my help.

301
00:19:01,849 --> 00:19:02,850
Mikoy.

302
00:19:22,661 --> 00:19:23,954
Dear.

303
00:19:25,414 --> 00:19:26,748
Why do you look so worried?

304
00:19:30,419 --> 00:19:33,422
Does Chiara really have to lead
the Concordat?

305
00:19:39,219 --> 00:19:41,889
You know we don't have a choice.

306
00:19:43,140 --> 00:19:46,143
Chiara is the only one who can become
the queen of the Concordat.

307
00:19:47,311 --> 00:19:50,981
Chiara is the only one who can bring
the mafia leaders to their knees.

308
00:19:53,192 --> 00:19:54,443
She's so happy now.

309
00:19:55,319 --> 00:19:56,945
She's happy here,

310
00:19:57,029 --> 00:19:58,197
with Mikoy and the others.

311
00:19:58,739 --> 00:19:59,656
Isn't she?

312
00:20:17,216 --> 00:20:18,634
I was happy once too.

313
00:20:24,431 --> 00:20:26,975
And that made me realize

314
00:20:27,768 --> 00:20:29,770
that real happiness

315
00:20:30,729 --> 00:20:33,357
isn't about being loved or loving someone.

316
00:20:43,575 --> 00:20:46,745
Being at the top,
where no one can bring you down.

317
00:20:47,621 --> 00:20:48,664
But, Mom…

318
00:20:49,164 --> 00:20:51,250
What if Chiara
really doesn't want it anymore?

319
00:20:54,002 --> 00:20:57,631
I'll destroy every reason
she has to be happy.

320
00:20:58,382 --> 00:21:01,426
I'll personally put
an end to Mikoy Pinagpala.

321
00:21:08,934 --> 00:21:09,893
Whose could this be?

322
00:21:11,478 --> 00:21:12,813
Someone from outside!

323
00:21:15,649 --> 00:21:16,775
Come on. Let's find out.

324
00:21:30,539 --> 00:21:33,125
Ma'am. Sorry to bother you.

325
00:21:34,584 --> 00:21:36,378
We found a motorcycle outside.

326
00:21:36,461 --> 00:21:39,214
Looks like we may have
an unauthorized visitor.

327
00:21:59,026 --> 00:22:01,528
<i>You need to fulfill your promise.</i>

328
00:22:02,446 --> 00:22:04,281
<i>Take the throne.</i>

329
00:22:06,199 --> 00:22:09,077
<i>He plans to use Mikoy's life,</i>

330
00:22:09,161 --> 00:22:10,287
<i>his family,</i>

331
00:22:10,370 --> 00:22:12,789
<i>even the people he loves against you</i>

332
00:22:12,873 --> 00:22:15,125
<i>if you go through with the wedding.</i>

333
00:22:24,634 --> 00:22:25,719
<i>You know,</i>

334
00:22:25,802 --> 00:22:28,346
<i>this thing about royal families,</i>

335
00:22:28,430 --> 00:22:31,099
<i>they marry for power.</i>

336
00:22:31,933 --> 00:22:33,977
<i>So if you become his wife,</i>

337
00:22:34,061 --> 00:22:37,314
<i>no one will challenge</i>
<i>his position anymore.</i>

338
00:22:38,023 --> 00:22:41,151
<i>His position as head</i>
<i>of the Concordat will be secure.</i>

339
00:22:42,486 --> 00:22:43,987
<i>To put an end to this,</i>

340
00:22:44,071 --> 00:22:45,864
<i>you need to kill</i>

341
00:22:45,947 --> 00:22:48,200
<i>whatever he's blackmailing you with,</i>

342
00:22:48,283 --> 00:22:50,202
<i>or the blackmailer himself.</i>

343
00:22:50,285 --> 00:22:51,620
<i>Choose.</i>

344
00:22:57,918 --> 00:23:01,671
Is this really the only way
to protect you, Mikoy?

345
00:23:03,757 --> 00:23:05,884
To go back to who I used to be?

346
00:23:23,193 --> 00:23:24,402
- Sir Mario?
- Rahmboy.

347
00:23:26,363 --> 00:23:27,656
- Rahmboy.
- I know.

348
00:23:29,407 --> 00:23:30,700
I’m just following orders.

349
00:23:31,910 --> 00:23:32,744
Rahmboy.

350
00:23:32,828 --> 00:23:33,745
I have a hunch.

351
00:23:33,829 --> 00:23:34,788
What hunch?

352
00:23:35,622 --> 00:23:37,457
I think Dad Mario knows something.

353
00:23:37,541 --> 00:23:40,210
He may have seen something
or followed someone.

354
00:23:44,047 --> 00:23:45,674
But why didn't he tell me?

355
00:23:45,757 --> 00:23:47,509
He's trying to protect you, Mikoy.

356
00:23:47,592 --> 00:23:49,553
He's trying to be a good father to you.

357
00:23:52,639 --> 00:23:54,182
Chiara!

358
00:23:54,266 --> 00:23:55,267
What happened?

359
00:23:55,350 --> 00:23:57,227
Rio has already sent someone to kill you.

360
00:23:57,310 --> 00:23:58,353
You need to do what he says!

361
00:23:58,436 --> 00:23:59,563
Kill Rio.

362
00:23:59,646 --> 00:24:01,439
So you and Mikoy can finally be free.

363
00:24:04,401 --> 00:24:05,735
I'll handle him.

364
00:24:19,541 --> 00:24:20,709
<i>We need you here.</i>

365
00:24:23,003 --> 00:24:24,004
Let’s go.
